<title>ESTONIA: UNION BK '96 GROUP PRE-TAX PROFIT 58.4 MLN EEK.</title>
<headline>UNION BK '96 GROUP PRE-TAX PROFIT 58.4 MLN EEK.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's Union Bank</p>
<p>reported its consolidated earnings for 1996.</p>
<p>					  1996     1995</p>
<p>				  (mln of kroons unless stated)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		    58.4	37.1</p>
<p> Interest income		  289.3     219.6</p>
<p> Interest expenses	     -116.2	79.0</p>
<p> Net interest income	    173.1     140.6</p>
<p> Fees and commissions	    36.2	26.6</p>
<p> Income on securities	    24.1	 7.1</p>
<p> Income on fin transcations    21.1	16.8</p>
<p> Total operating income	 254.4     191.2</p>
<p> Operation costs/overheads   -151.7    -112.8</p>
<p> Income tax			  -0.4	-1.2</p>
<p> Minority interests		-0.5	-0.6</p>
<p> Net profit			  57.5	35.3</p>
<p> General Banking reserve	-57.5	29.0</p>
<p> Dividends			    0	   6.3</p>
<p>    -- Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
